{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thermo-lesson04","version":1,"title":"熱力学","subtitle":"第4回 · エンタルピーと理想気体の過程","scope":"熱力学 4.pdf、全13物理ページ。エンタルピーと理想気体の過程。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期火１]熱力学/熱力学 4.pdf","sha256":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2","pageCount":13,"reviewedPages":[4,5,7,8,9,12,13],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"thermo-l04-q01","version":1,"prompt":"物質量一定の単純圧縮系で、定圧熱容量CpはエンタルピーHのどの偏微分？","answer":"\\(C_p=(\\partial H/\\partial T)_p\\)。","criterion":"圧力一定での温度による偏微分と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":5,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:5"}],"promptHtml":"物質量一定の単純圧縮系で、定圧熱容量CpはエンタルピーHのどの偏微分？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p=(\\partial H/\\partial T)_p</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"圧力一定での温度による偏微分と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q02","version":1,"prompt":"同じ圧力でのモル蒸発エンタルピーをT1からT2へ換算する。気体と液体のモル定圧熱容量をCp,gとCp,lとすると、加える補正は？","answer":"\\(\\int_{T_1}^{T_2}(C_{p,g}-C_{p,l})\\,dT\\)。","criterion":"気体から液体の熱容量を引いた差を積分できれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":4,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:4"}],"promptHtml":"同じ圧力でのモル蒸発エンタルピーをT1からT2へ換算する。気体と液体のモル定圧熱容量をCp,gとCp,lとすると、加える補正は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{T_1}^{T_2}(C_{p,g}-C_{p,l})\\,dT</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"気体から液体の熱容量を引いた差を積分できれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q03","version":1,"prompt":"n molの液体が温度Tで理想気体へ蒸発する。液体体積を無視すると、蒸発の内部エネルギー変化ΔUとエンタルピー変化ΔHの関係は？","answer":"\\(\\Delta U=\\Delta H-nRT\\)。","criterion":"ΔHからnRTを引くと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":4,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:4"}],"promptHtml":"n molの液体が温度Tで理想気体へ蒸発する。液体体積を無視すると、蒸発の内部エネルギー変化ΔUとエンタルピー変化ΔHの関係は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta U=\\Delta H-nRT</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"ΔHからnRTを引くと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q04","version":1,"prompt":"物質量一定の系で、Cp−Cvを内部エネルギーUと体積Vの偏微分で表すと？","answer":"\\(C_p-C_v=[(\\partial U/\\partial V)_T+p](\\partial V/\\partial T)_p\\)。","criterion":"体積依存の項と膨張仕事の項を含めて言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:7"}],"promptHtml":"物質量一定の系で、Cp−Cvを内部エネルギーUと体積Vの偏微分で表すと？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p-C_v=[(\\partial U/\\partial V)_T+p](\\partial V/\\partial T)_p</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"体積依存の項と膨張仕事の項を含めて言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q05","version":1,"prompt":"n molの理想気体の定圧熱容量Cpと定積熱容量Cvの差は？Rは気体定数。","answer":"\\(C_p-C_v=nR\\)。","criterion":"全体の熱容量ではnRと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:8"}],"promptHtml":"n molの理想気体の定圧熱容量Cpと定積熱容量Cvの差は？Rは気体定数。","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p-C_v=nR</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"全体の熱容量ではnRと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q06","version":1,"prompt":"n molの理想気体が温度T一定でV1からV2へ可逆膨張する。系が受ける仕事Wは？","answer":"\\(W=-nRT\\log(V_2/V_1)\\)。","criterion":"膨張で負になる対数の式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:9"}],"promptHtml":"n molの理想気体が温度T一定でV1からV2へ可逆膨張する。系が受ける仕事Wは？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=-nRT\\log(V_2/V_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"膨張で負になる対数の式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q07","version":1,"prompt":"熱容量一定の理想気体の可逆断熱過程で、圧力pと体積Vの関係は？γ=Cp/Cvとする。","answer":"\\(pV^\\gamma=\\text{一定}\\)。","criterion":"γ乗を含む関係を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":13,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:13"}],"promptHtml":"熱容量一定の理想気体の可逆断熱過程で、圧力pと体積Vの関係は？γ=Cp/Cvとする。","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>一定</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pV^\\gamma=\\text{一定}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"γ乗を含む関係を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l04-q08","version":1,"prompt":"n molの理想気体を断熱変化させる。モル定積熱容量Cv,mは一定とする。系が受ける仕事は、始温度T1と終温度T2でどう表せる？","answer":"\\(W=\\Delta U=nC_{v,m}(T_2-T_1)\\)。","criterion":"断熱なので仕事が内部エネルギー変化に等しいと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 4.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:12"}],"promptHtml":"n molの理想気体を断熱変化させる。モル定積熱容量Cv,mは一定とする。系が受ける仕事は、始温度T1と終温度T2でどう表せる？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\Delta U=nC_{v,m}(T_2-T_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"断熱なので仕事が内部エネルギー変化に等しいと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:5":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-5.png","5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:4":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-4.png","5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:7":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-7.png","5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:8":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-8.png","5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:9":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-9.png","5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:13":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-13.png","5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2:12":"./assets/sources/5e1d70c334ae66a0bda35d336a9134481183320516bd780d187fe0c7af6da5d2-12.png"},"renderVersion":1}